#: ../../solver-patchers.md:70
msgid ""
"The final CSVs (`RELAC_TX_Inputs.csv`, `RELAC_TX_Outputs.csv`, "
"`RELAC_TX_Combined_Inputs_Outputs.csv`) always use `prefix_final_files`. "
"Until 2026-09-11 storage-delay runs used a separate "
"`RELAC_TX_StorageDelay_` prefix; that desynced the `outs` in `dvc.yaml` "
"(so `dvc repro` failed after the solve) and the consumers that read the "
"un-prefixed name (dashboard, D4). B2 now checks at startup that the "
"`dvc.yaml` outs carry `prefix_final_files` and aborts otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Los CSV finales (`RELAC_TX_Inputs.csv`, `RELAC_TX_Outputs.csv`, "
"`RELAC_TX_Combined_Inputs_Outputs.csv`) siempre usan "
"`prefix_final_files`. Hasta el 2026-09-11 las corridas con retraso de "
"almacenamiento usaban un prefijo separado `RELAC_TX_StorageDelay_`; eso "
"desincronizaba los `outs` en `dvc.yaml` (por lo que `dvc repro` fallaba "
"después de resolver) y a los consumidores que leen el nombre sin prefijo "
"(dashboard, D4). B2 ahora verifica al inicio que los outs de `dvc.yaml` "
"lleven `prefix_final_files` y aborta en caso contrario."

#: ../../solver-patchers.md:73
msgid ""
"`storage_delay_active` is mutually exclusive with `strip_storage_active`."
" When storage-delay is on, B2 silently forces `strip_storage_active = "
"False`."
msgstr ""
"`storage_delay_active` es mutuamente excluyente con "
"`strip_storage_active`. Cuando el retraso de almacenamiento está activo, "
"B2 fuerza silenciosamente `strip_storage_active = False`."

#: ../../solver-patchers.md:76
msgid ""
"[`patch_storage_delay.py`](https://github.com/Climate-Lead-Group/OSTRAM-"
"LAC/blob/main/scripts/pipeline/patch_storage_delay.py) keeps storage in "
"the model but blocks storage builds for the first N years "
"(`storage_delay_first_n_years`), then reopens the linked PWR storage "
"technologies so the optimiser can add storage afterwards."
msgstr ""
"[`patch_storage_delay.py`](https://github.com/Climate-Lead-Group/OSTRAM-"
"LAC/blob/main/scripts/pipeline/patch_storage_delay.py) mantiene el "
"almacenamiento en el modelo pero bloquea la construcción de "
"almacenamiento durante los primeros N años "
"(`storage_delay_first_n_years`), y luego reabre las tecnologías de "
"almacenamiento PWR vinculadas para que el optimizador pueda agregar "
"almacenamiento después."

#: ../../solver-patchers.md:78
msgid "The modifiers"
msgstr "Los modificadores"

#: ../../solver-patchers.md:80
msgid "1. DaysInDayType injector"
msgstr "1\\. Inyector de DaysInDayType"

#: ../../solver-patchers.md:82
msgid ""
"**Script:** [`inject_DaysInDayType.py`](https://github.com/Climate-Lead-"
"Group/OSTRAM-LAC/blob/main/scripts/pipeline/inject_DaysInDayType.py) · "
"runs unconditionally."
msgstr ""
"**Script:** [`inject_DaysInDayType.py`](https://github.com/Climate-Lead-"
"Group/OSTRAM-LAC/blob/main/scripts/pipeline/inject_DaysInDayType.py) · se"
" ejecuta incondicionalmente."

#: ../../solver-patchers.md:84
msgid ""
"The `B1 → otoole → preprocess` chain never generates the `DaysInDayType` "
"block, so the `.txt` ships with an empty block and OSeMOSYS falls back to"
" `default = 7`. With 4 seasons × 1 daytype, storage equations then treat "
"the year as 4 × 7 = 28 days while the energy balance uses the real year "
"length. This modifier writes the correct `DaysInDayType` values in place."
msgstr ""
"La cadena `B1 → otoole → preprocess` nunca genera el bloque "
"`DaysInDayType`, por lo que el `.txt` sale con un bloque vacío y OSeMOSYS"
" recurre a `default = 7`. Con 4 estaciones × 1 daytype, las ecuaciones de"
" almacenamiento tratan entonces el año como 4 × 7 = 28 días mientras el "
"balance energético usa la duración real del año. Este modificador escribe"
" los valores correctos de `DaysInDayType` en su lugar."

