#: ../../solver-patchers.md:116
msgid ""
"`PWRBCK*` are high-cost backstop generators that absorb feasibility edge "
"cases. If their `TotalAnnualMaxCapacity` / "
"`TotalAnnualMaxCapacityInvestment` are hardcapped at 0, the safety net is"
" removed and the linear program can become infeasible. This modifier "
"reopens those caps."
msgstr ""
"`PWRBCK*` son generadores de respaldo (backstop) de alto costo que "
"absorben casos límite de factibilidad. Si su `TotalAnnualMaxCapacity` / "
"`TotalAnnualMaxCapacityInvestment` están topados en 0, se elimina la red "
"de seguridad y el programa lineal puede volverse infactible. Este "
"modificador reabre esos topes."

