" whose `Parameter` equals `activity_upper_limit_parameter_label`. Each "
"year cell holds a fraction in `[0, 1]` of that country's electricity "
"demand. The modifier maps each tech to its demand fuel via "
"`OutputActivityRatio`, converts `fraction × demand / OutputActivityRatio`"
" into an absolute cap, and rewrites the "
"`TotalTechnologyAnnualActivityUpperLimit` block."
msgstr ""
"Lee filas de la hoja `Secondary Techs` de `A-O_Parametrization.xlsx` cuyo"
" `Parameter` sea igual a `activity_upper_limit_parameter_label`. Cada "
"celda de año contiene una fracción en `[0, 1]` de la demanda eléctrica de"
" ese país. El modificador mapea cada tecnología a su energético de "
"demanda mediante `OutputActivityRatio`, convierte `fraction × demand / "
"OutputActivityRatio` en un tope absoluto, y reescribe el bloque "
"`TotalTechnologyAnnualActivityUpperLimit`."

