"Writes the lower limit constraints of the fossil fleet, per-technology "
"`TotalTechnologyAnnualActivityLowerLimit` values, so the optimiser cannot"
" dump thermal dispatch below its calibrated/committed level. Runs once "
"per base scenario listed in `dispatch_floors_scenarios`; derived "
"scenarios inherit the `FLOORED` file. Before writing, B2 runs a read-only"
" gate ([`preflight_separation.py`](https://github.com/Climate-Lead-Group"
"/OSTRAM-LAC/blob/main/scripts/fix_dispatch/preflight_separation.py)); a "
"non-zero exit aborts the pipeline."
msgstr ""
